nge: 18 m (60 ft)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"AoE: 9 m (30 ft) Radius\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> AoE: 9 m (30 ft) Radius</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Randomly generated in <a href=\"/wiki/Traders\" title=\"Traders\">trader</a> inventories upon interaction with higher level characters, typically in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a></li>\n<li>In a buried chest in <a href=\"/wiki/Rivington\" title=\"Rivington\">Rivington</a>, inside a barn at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;37&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-149</span></li>\n<li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Philgrave%27s_Mansion#Basement\" title=\"Philgrave's Mansion\">basement of Philgrave's Mansion</a></li>\n<li>In the office room of the <a href=\"/wiki/Murder_Tribunal\" title=\"Murder Tribunal\">Murder Tribunal</a></li>\n<li>In an opulent chest in the <a href=\"/wiki/Cloister_of_Sombre_Embrace\" title=\"Cloister of Sombre Embrace\">Cloister of Sombre Embrace</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-395&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-1672</span></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195726\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.061 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.064 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count